{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "Licenses": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Licencias"}}}},
    "Alondra": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra"}}}},
    "Functional Source License 1.1, MIT Future License": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Functional Source License 1.1, con licencia MIT futura"}}}},
    "The Alondra name and logo are not licensed.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El nombre y el logotipo de Alondra no tienen licencia."}}}},
    "Third-party software": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Software de terceros"}}}},
    "License": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Licencia"}}}},
    "Open-source packages linked into the apps, each under its own license.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Paquetes de código abierto incluidos en las apps, cada uno con su propia licencia."}}}},
    "Share": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Compartir"}}}},
    "Couldn’t download it from your Mac · Retry": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo descargar desde tu Mac · Reintentar"}}}},
    "This file is no longer on your Mac as the card names it": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este archivo ya no está en tu Mac tal como lo nombra la tarjeta"}}}},
    "Image, %@, %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Imagen, %1$@, %2$@"}}}},
    "Opens it full screen": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "La abre a pantalla completa"}}}},
    "Downloading %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Descargando %@"}}}},
    "Download and play · %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Descargar y reproducir · %@"}}}},
    "Video, %@, %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vídeo, %1$@, %2$@"}}}},
    "Downloads it from your Mac and plays it": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lo descarga desde tu Mac y lo reproduce"}}}},
    "Stop": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Detener"}}}},
    "Downloading…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Descargando…"}}}},
    "Play %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Reproducir %@"}}}},
    "Opens it with Quick Look": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Lo abre con Vista rápida"}}}},
    "Optional": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Opcional"}}}},
    "Choose…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Elige…"}}}},
    "Fill in %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Rellena %@"}}}},
    "Check %@: it is outside what it allows": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Revisa %@: está fuera de lo que admite"}}}},
    "%@ to %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "De %1$@ a %2$@"}}}},
    "At least %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Al menos %@"}}}},
    "At most %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Como mucho %@"}}}},
    "Alondra on your Mac could not do it.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra en tu Mac no pudo hacerlo."}}}},
    "since now": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "desde ahora"}}}},
    "Finished subagents": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Subagentes terminados"}}}},
    "Finished in the background": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Terminado en segundo plano"}}}},
    "Hides it": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "La oculta"}}}},
    "Shows it": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "La muestra"}}}},
    "Send a crash report": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Enviar informe de fallo"}}}},
    "Logs of your Mac with everything private left out. You see all of it before it is sent.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Logs de tu Mac con todo lo privado fuera. Lo ves entero antes de enviarlo."}}}},
    "Collecting the report: the logs, the tasks and the nodes of the last hours…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Recogiendo el informe: los logs, las tareas y los nodos de las últimas horas…"}}}},
    "Nothing leaves your Mac until you say so.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No sale nada de tu Mac hasta que lo digas."}}}},
    "Open the issue": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Abrir el issue"}}}},
    "It stays on your Mac.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Se queda en tu Mac."}}}},
    "To send it later, run alondra report send %@ on your Mac.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Para enviarlo luego, ejecuta alondra report send %@ en tu Mac."}}}},
    "Nothing was sent; it stays on your Mac. To send it later, run alondra report send %@ on your Mac.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se ha enviado nada; se queda en tu Mac. Para enviarlo luego, ejecuta alondra report send %@ en tu Mac."}}}},
    "Crash report": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Informe de fallo"}}}},
    "What happened?": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿Qué pasó?"}}}},
    "Prepare the report": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Preparar el informe"}}}},
    "Optional. It goes exactly as you write it, and anyone who sees the report can read it. Your Mac then collects its logs, tasks and nodes of the last 72 hours with everything private left out, and shows you all of it before anything is sent.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Opcional. Va tal cual lo escribas, y cualquiera que vea el informe podrá leerlo. Después tu Mac recoge sus logs, tareas y nodos de las últimas 72 horas con todo lo privado fuera, y te lo enseña entero antes de enviar nada."}}}},
    "Last %lld hours": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Últimas %lld horas"}}}},
    "Nothing written": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No escribiste nada"}}}},
    "Nothing has left your Mac yet.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Todavía no ha salido nada de tu Mac."}}}},
    "Open any file to see it whole, exactly as it would be sent.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Abre cualquier fichero para verlo entero, tal cual se enviaría."}}}},
    "Left out": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fuera del informe"}}}},
    "The final check found nothing private.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "La comprobación final no encontró nada privado."}}}},
    "This is exactly what is sent. Anyone with the link of its issue will be able to read it, also what you wrote in “What happened?”, which goes as you wrote it.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esto es exactamente lo que se envía. Cualquiera con el enlace del issue podrá leerlo, también lo que escribiste en «¿Qué pasó?», que va tal cual."}}}},
    "The report cannot leave your Mac; the final check found:": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El informe no puede salir de tu Mac; la comprobación final encontró:"}}}},
    "%@, line %lld: %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@, línea %2$lld: %3$@"}}}},
    "Sending it to %@…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Enviándolo a %@…"}}}},
    "Yes, send it": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sí, enviarlo"}}}},
    "No, keep it on this Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No, que se quede en este Mac"}}}},
    "Send it to %@? Anyone who sees its issue will be able to read it.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿Lo envío a %@? Cualquiera que vea el issue podrá leerlo."}}}},
    "No report repository is set up, so the report stays on your Mac.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No hay ningún repositorio de informes configurado, así que el informe se queda en tu Mac."}}}},
    "New report": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nuevo informe"}}}},
    "log lines no template of the code has": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "líneas del log que no son de ninguna plantilla del código"}}}},
    "lifecycle events it could not read": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "eventos del ciclo de vida que no pudo leer"}}}},
    "SDK hosts with a name it does not know": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "hosts del SDK con un nombre que no conoce"}}}},
    "SDK host frames it could not read": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "mensajes del host del SDK que no pudo leer"}}}},
    "SDK host frames of a type it does not know": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "mensajes del host del SDK de un tipo que no conoce"}}}},
    "cut to fit in 5 MB: the oldest %lld lines of %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "recortado para que quepa en 5 MB: las %1$lld líneas más antiguas de %2$@"}}}},
    "Alondra’s service is not answering: open Terminal and run alondra report.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El servicio de Alondra no responde: abre Terminal y ejecuta alondra report."}}}},
    "Your Mac is not answering: run alondra report on it.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no responde: ejecuta alondra report en él."}}}},
    "Alondra on your Mac answered with something that is not a report.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra en tu Mac respondió algo que no es un informe."}}}},
    "Let Alondra alert you.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Que Alondra te avise."}}}},
    "When an agent asks you something or finishes, you’ll see it here even with the app closed. You can answer from the Lock Screen.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cuando un agente te pregunte algo o termine, lo verás aquí aunque la app esté cerrada. Puedes responder desde la pantalla bloqueada."}}}},
    "Alerts for Alondra are off in iOS Settings. Turn them on there to get them on this iPhone.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Los avisos de Alondra están desactivados en los Ajustes de iOS. Actívalos allí para recibirlos en este iPhone."}}}},
    "Turn On Alerts": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Activar los avisos"}}}},
    "Not Now": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ahora no"}}}},
    "MCP servers": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Servidores MCP"}}}},
    "Metrics": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Métricas"}}}},
    "Name of the new account": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nombre de la cuenta nueva"}}}},
    "Work": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Trabajo"}}}},
    "Add": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Añadir"}}}},
    "Finish in Terminal": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Termina en Terminal"}}}},
    "Finish on the Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Termina en el Mac"}}}},
    "Your tasks carry on by themselves. When one needs you, it will show up here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus tareas siguen solas. Cuando una te necesite, aparecerá aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it needs": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué necesita"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Workflows": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flujos de trabajo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
