    "Wi-Fi": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Wi-Fi"}}}},
    "Mobile data": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Datos móviles"}}}},
    "Ethernet": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ethernet"}}}},
    "Offline": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sin conexión"}}}},
    "Other network": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Otra red"}}}},
    "%lld failed": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld con error"}}}},
    "%lld ms · p90 %lld ms": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld ms · p90 %lld ms"}}}},
    "Not connected": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sin conexión"}}}},
    "Your Mac hasn’t confirmed your answer to “%@”.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac aún no ha confirmado tu respuesta a «%@»."}}}},
    "Your Mac hasn’t confirmed an answer.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac aún no ha confirmado una respuesta."}}}},
    "Couldn’t send · Retrying…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo enviar · Reintentando…"}}}},
    "Your Mac hasn’t confirmed it yet · Retrying…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac aún no lo ha confirmado · Reintentando…"}}}},
    "Retry now": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Reintentar ahora"}}}},
    "Permissions allowed always": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Permisos permitidos siempre"}}}},
    "Nodes in each repo run these commands without asking. Remove one and the next call asks again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Los nodos de cada repo ejecutan estos comandos sin preguntar. Si quitas uno, la siguiente llamada vuelve a preguntar."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t remove the permission. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no ha quitado el permiso. Inténtalo de nuevo."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t remove the permission.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no ha quitado el permiso."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t get the new folder. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no ha recibido la carpeta nueva. Vuelve a intentarlo."}}}},
    "Your Mac couldn’t open this folder.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no ha podido abrir esta carpeta."}}}},
    "%lld repos": {"localizations": {"en": {"variations": {"plural": {"one": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld repo"}}, "other": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld repos"}}}}}, "es": {"variations": {"plural": {"one": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld repo"}}, "other": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld repos"}}}}}}},
    "Other…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Otra carpeta…"}}}},
    "Projects folder": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Carpeta de proyectos"}}}},
    "Notifications and access away from home": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Notificaciones y acceso fuera de casa"}}}},
    "On": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Activado"}}}},
    "Off": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Desactivado"}}}},
    "Without it you only get updates while the app is open on the same Wi-Fi.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sin esto solo ves novedades con la app abierta en la misma wifi."}}}},
    "To change it, run `alondra relay` on this Mac.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Para cambiarlo, ejecuta `alondra relay` en este Mac."}}}},
    "Use This Folder": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Usar esta carpeta"}}}},
    "This Mac’s settings": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ajustes de este Mac"}}}},
    "This Mac’s Settings…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ajustes de este Mac…"}}}},
    "Install it with Homebrew (`brew install bitomule/tap/alondra`), then run `alondra` once. This window connects as soon as it answers.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Instálalo con Homebrew (`brew install bitomule/tap/alondra`) y ejecuta `alondra` una vez. Esta ventana se conecta en cuanto responda."}}}},
    "Install it with Homebrew, then run it once:": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Instálalo con Homebrew y ejecútalo una vez:"}}}},
    "This window connects as soon as it answers.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esta ventana se conecta en cuanto responda."}}}},
    "Not there? On your Mac run:": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿No aparece? En tu Mac ejecuta:"}}}},
    "Is Alondra running on your Mac? Run `alondra` in Terminal, and keep both devices on the same Wi-Fi.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿Está Alondra en marcha en tu Mac? Ejecuta `alondra` en Terminal y mantén los dos dispositivos en la misma wifi."}}}},
    "Used %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Usado %@"}}}},
    "Not used yet": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sin uso todavía"}}}},
    "Change": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cambiar"}}}},
    "How many nodes work at the same time on the Mac. The rest wait their turn.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cuántos nodos trabajan a la vez en el Mac. Los demás esperan su turno."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t get the new limit. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El nuevo límite no llegó a tu Mac. Vuelve a probar."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t take the new limit.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no aceptó el nuevo límite."}}}},
    "Nodes at once: %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nodos a la vez: %@"}}}},
    "How the Mac merges a PR when you press its button or it merges on its own. If a repository doesn’t allow this method, it uses the first one the repository allows.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cómo hace el Mac el merge de una PR cuando pulsas su botón o cuando la mergea solo. Si un repositorio no permite este modo, usa el primero que sí permite."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t take the new merge method.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no aceptó el nuevo modo de merge."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t get the new merge method. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El nuevo modo de merge no llegó a tu Mac. Vuelve a probar."}}}},
    "How a node brings main into its PR’s branch when the PR has conflicts. With rebase it pushes with --force-with-lease, only to its own task’s branch; if the rebase gets hard, it merges that once and says so.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cómo trae un nodo main a la rama de su PR cuando la PR tiene conflictos. Con rebase sube con --force-with-lease, solo a la rama de su propia tarea; si el rebase se complica, hace merge esa vez y lo dice."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t take the new way to update branches.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no aceptó el nuevo modo de actualizar la rama."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t get the new way to update branches. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El nuevo modo de actualizar la rama no llegó a tu Mac. Vuelve a probar."}}}},
    "Copy": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Copiar"}}}},
    "Copied": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Copiado"}}}},
    "Copies the whole block": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Copia el bloque entero"}}}},
    "This %@ is no longer paired with “%@”": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este %1$@ ya no está emparejado con “%2$@”"}}}},
    "This %@ is no longer paired with your Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este %@ ya no está emparejado con tu Mac"}}}},
    "There’s a Mac with this name but a different identity. Pair it again only if you reinstalled that Mac.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hay un Mac con este nombre pero con otra identidad. Vuelve a emparejarlo solo si reinstalaste ese Mac."}}}},
    "Pair it again to keep using it.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vuelve a emparejarlo para seguir usándolo."}}}},
    "Connection": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conexión"}}}},
    "Connected to": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conectado a"}}}},
    "Alondra on this Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra en este Mac"}}}},
    "This Mac talks to its own Alondra directly. No account is needed.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este Mac habla directamente con su propio Alondra. No hace falta ninguna cuenta."}}}},
    "Alondra needs your local network": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra necesita tu red local"}}}},
    "To find the Macs on this Wi-Fi, iOS will ask whether Alondra may use your local network. Alondra only talks to your Macs, always encrypted.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Para encontrar los Mac de esta wifi, iOS te preguntará si Alondra puede usar tu red local. Alondra solo habla con tus Mac, y siempre cifrado."}}}},
    "To find the other Macs on this Wi-Fi, macOS will ask whether Alondra may use your local network. Alondra only talks to your Macs, always encrypted.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Para encontrar los otros Mac de esta wifi, macOS te preguntará si Alondra puede usar tu red local. Alondra solo habla con tus Mac, y siempre cifrado."}}}},
    "Local network access is off": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El acceso a la red local está desactivado"}}}},
    "Alondra can’t look for your Macs until you turn on Local Network for it in Settings.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no puede buscar tus Mac hasta que actives Red local para Alondra en Ajustes."}}}},
    "Alondra can’t look for other Macs until you turn on Local Network for it in System Settings.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no puede buscar otros Mac hasta que actives Red local para Alondra en Ajustes del Sistema."}}}},
    "Open System Settings": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Abrir Ajustes del Sistema"}}}},
    "It doesn’t answer on this network: check that it’s on and on the same network. Alondra reconnects as soon as it answers; to reach it away from home, turn on Tailscale on both.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No responde en esta red: comprueba que está encendido y en la misma red. Alondra se reconecta en cuanto responda; para llegar a él fuera de casa, activa Tailscale en los dos."}}}},
    "That’s this Mac. Pick another one.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ese es este Mac. Elige otro."}}}},
    "This device only connects to that address securely. Use the Mac’s IP address, like 192.168.1.20 or 100.101.2.3, or its name ending in .ts.net.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este dispositivo solo se conecta a esa dirección de forma segura. Usa la IP del Mac, como 192.168.1.20 o 100.101.2.3, o su nombre terminado en .ts.net."}}}},
    "On this Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En este Mac"}}}},
    "On the local network": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En la red local"}}}},
    "Via Tailscale": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Por Tailscale"}}}},
    "Via the relay": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Por el relay"}}}},
    "This Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este Mac"}}}},
    "The Mac didn’t allow this device.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El Mac no ha permitido este dispositivo."}}}},
    "The request expired before the Mac answered. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "La petición caducó antes de que el Mac respondiera. Vuelve a intentarlo."}}}},
    "The Mac has too many requests right now. Try again in a few minutes.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El Mac tiene demasiadas peticiones ahora mismo. Vuelve a intentarlo en unos minutos."}}}},
    "Can’t reach that Mac. Check that it’s on and on this network.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se puede llegar a ese Mac. Comprueba que está encendido y en esta red."}}}},
    "Alondra couldn’t pair with that Mac. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no ha podido emparejarse con ese Mac. Vuelve a intentarlo."}}}},
    "Pairing was cancelled.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Se ha cancelado el emparejamiento."}}}},
    "This Mac is already linked. Select it in Settings.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este Mac ya está vinculado. Selecciónalo en Ajustes."}}}},
    "Find your Mac.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Busca tu Mac."}}}},
    "Same code on both?": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿El mismo código en los dos?"}}}},
    "Macs running Alondra on this Wi-Fi appear here. No account needed, but this iPhone gets no alerts.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aquí aparecen los Mac de esta wifi que usan Alondra. Sin cuenta, pero este iPhone no recibe avisos."}}}},
    "Alerts reach this iPhone through your Alondra account. Your Macs are linked without one, so they can’t send alerts.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Los avisos llegan a este iPhone a través de tu cuenta de Alondra. Tus Mac están vinculados sin cuenta y no pueden enviarlos."}}}},
    "Use my account": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Usar mi cuenta"}}}},
    "Your Mac asks whether to allow this iPhone. Allow it only if it shows this same code.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac pregunta si permite este iPhone. Permítelo solo si muestra este mismo código."}}}},
    "Find": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Buscar"}}}},
    "Compare": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Comparar"}}}},
    "Access from anywhere": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Acceder desde cualquier sitio"}}}},
    "Connecting to %@…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conectando con %@…"}}}},
    "Check the code on %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Comprueba el código en %@"}}}},
    "Looking for Macs on this network…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Buscando Mac en esta red…"}}}},
    "Linked": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Vinculado"}}}},
    "Add by address": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Añadir por dirección"}}}},
    "For a Mac on Tailscale or another network, type its address.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Para un Mac en Tailscale o en otra red, escribe su dirección."}}}},
    "192.168.1.20 or studio.tailnet.ts.net": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "192.168.1.20 o studio.tailnet.ts.net"}}}},
    "Find a Mac on this network": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Buscar un Mac en esta red"}}}},
    "Alondra on your iPhone connects to the Mac where your agents work.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra en el iPhone se conecta al Mac donde trabajan tus agentes."}}}},
    "With your account": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Con tu cuenta"}}}},
    "Alerts on this iPhone, and access from anywhere.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avisos en este iPhone y acceso desde cualquier sitio."}}}},
    "Only on this Wi-Fi": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Solo en esta Wi‑Fi"}}}},
    "No account. No alerts on this iPhone: open the app to see what needs you.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sin cuenta. Sin avisos en este iPhone: abre la app para ver qué te necesita."}}}},
    "Recommended": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Recomendado"}}}},
    "Don't have Alondra on your Mac yet?": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿Aún no tienes Alondra en el Mac?"}}}},
    "Run in Terminal:": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ejecuta en Terminal:"}}}},
    "Start with your account.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Empieza con tu cuenta."}}}},
    "Alerts on this iPhone, and your Mac within reach from anywhere.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Avisos en este iPhone y tu Mac a mano desde cualquier sitio."}}}},
    "Sign in with Alondra": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inicia sesión en Alondra"}}}},
    "Open Terminal on your Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Abre Terminal en tu Mac"}}}},
    "Run this command to show your connection code.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ejecuta este comando para mostrar tu código de conexión."}}}},
    "Sign in there with the same account:": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inicia sesión allí con la misma cuenta:"}}}},
    "Then show your connection code:": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Después muestra tu código de conexión:"}}}},
    "Find a Mac on this network instead": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Buscar un Mac en esta red"}}}},
    "Use an account instead": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Usar una cuenta"}}}},
    "That Mac asks whether to allow this one. Allow it only if it shows this same code.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ese Mac pregunta si permite este. Permítelo solo si muestra este mismo código."}}}},
    "Waiting for the other Mac…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esperando al otro Mac…"}}}},
    "Add a Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Añadir un Mac"}}}},
    "Forget": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Olvidar"}}}},
    "Forget Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Olvidar Mac"}}}},
    "Forget this Mac?": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿Olvidar este Mac?"}}}},
    "Forget This Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Olvidar este Mac"}}}},
    "This iPhone deletes its keys for this Mac. To use it again, find it and pair it again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este iPhone borra sus claves para este Mac. Para volver a usarlo, búscalo y vuelve a emparejarlo."}}}},
    "This Mac deletes its keys for the other Mac. To use it again, find it and pair it again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este Mac borra sus claves para el otro Mac. Para volver a usarlo, búscalo y vuelve a emparejarlo."}}}},
    "Alondra couldn’t forget this Mac. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no ha podido olvidar este Mac. Vuelve a intentarlo."}}}},
    "Macs": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Macs"}}}},
    "Connect to Another Mac…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conectar con otro Mac…"}}}},
    "Devices that can use this Mac": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Dispositivos que pueden usar este Mac"}}}},
    "No other device can use this Mac yet.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Todavía ningún otro dispositivo puede usar este Mac."}}}},
    "Revoking a device cuts it off on every path at once.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Revocar un dispositivo le corta el acceso por todas las vías a la vez."}}}},
    "Revoke": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Revocar"}}}},
    "Revoke this device?": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿Revocar este dispositivo?"}}}},
    "It loses access to this Mac at once, on the local network and through the relay.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Pierde el acceso a este Mac al momento, en la red local y por el relay."}}}},
    "Alondra couldn’t read the devices of this Mac.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no ha podido leer los dispositivos de este Mac."}}}},
    "Alondra couldn’t revoke this device. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no ha podido revocar este dispositivo. Vuelve a intentarlo."}}}},
    "A device wants to use Alondra": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Un dispositivo quiere usar Alondra"}}}},
    "Allow “%@” only if its screen shows this same code.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Permite «%@» solo si su pantalla muestra este mismo código."}}}},
    "Allowed in this task": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Permitido en esta tarea"}}}},
    "Allow “%@” to use Alondra?": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿Permitir que «%@» use Alondra?"}}}},
    "Code %@. Allow it only if the device shows the same code.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Código %@. Permítelo solo si el dispositivo muestra el mismo código."}}}},
    "The Mac didn’t take that answer. The request may have expired.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El Mac no ha aceptado esa respuesta. Puede que la petición haya caducado."}}}},
    "Can’t reach your Mac. Retrying…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se puede contactar con tu Mac. Reintentando…"}}}},
    "Alondra’s relay isn’t responding. Retrying…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El relay de Alondra no responde. Reintentando…"}}}},
    "Alerts couldn’t be set up on this device. Alondra tries again when you reopen the app.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudieron preparar los avisos en este dispositivo. Alondra lo vuelve a intentar cuando abras la app de nuevo."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t accept this device’s alerts. Alondra tries again when you reopen the app.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no aceptó los avisos de este dispositivo. Alondra lo vuelve a intentar cuando abras la app de nuevo."}}}},
    "Two linked Macs look like the same Mac. Remove one in Settings and link it again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Dos Macs vinculados parecen el mismo Mac. Quita uno en Ajustes y vuelve a vincularlo."}}}},
    "Signing out didn’t finish. Finish signing out to continue.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo terminar de cerrar sesión. Termina de cerrar sesión para continuar."}}}},
    "Your session couldn’t be renewed. Sign out and sign in again to reconnect.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo renovar tu sesión. Cierra sesión y vuelve a iniciarla para reconectar."}}}},
    "Your account is busy with another step. Try again in a moment.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu cuenta está terminando otro paso. Inténtalo de nuevo en un momento."}}}},
    "The sign-in service isn’t working right now. Try again later.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El servicio de inicio de sesión no funciona ahora mismo. Inténtalo más tarde."}}}},
    "The sign-in service isn’t answering. Alondra keeps trying.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El servicio de inicio de sesión no responde. Alondra lo sigue intentando."}}}},
    "This device couldn’t read its saved sign-in. Restart the app and try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este dispositivo no pudo leer su inicio de sesión guardado. Reinicia la app e inténtalo de nuevo."}}}},
    "Sign-in couldn’t be completed. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo completar el inicio de sesión. Inténtalo de nuevo."}}}},
    "This QR code isn’t from Alondra. Scan the code your Mac shows.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este código QR no es de Alondra. Escanea el código que muestra tu Mac."}}}},
    "This QR code has expired. Show a new one on your Mac and scan it.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este código QR ha caducado. Muestra uno nuevo en tu Mac y escanéalo."}}}},
    "Linking didn’t finish. Show a new QR code on your Mac and scan it again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "La vinculación no terminó. Muestra un código QR nuevo en tu Mac y vuelve a escanearlo."}}}},
    "Alondra can’t use this device’s storage": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no puede usar el almacenamiento de este dispositivo"}}}},
    "storage problem on this device": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "problema de almacenamiento en este dispositivo"}}}},
    "This isn’t a connection problem: your Mac and your pairing are fine. Free up some space on this device, then try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No es un problema de conexión: tu Mac y el emparejamiento están bien. Libera algo de espacio en este dispositivo y vuelve a intentarlo."}}}},
    "Your Mac didn’t confirm some answers": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tu Mac no confirmó algunas respuestas"}}}},
    "Alondra couldn’t read the answers this device was still sending, so it set them aside instead of sending them again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no pudo leer las respuestas que este dispositivo aún estaba enviando, así que las ha apartado en vez de volver a enviarlas."}}}},
    "Any card you answered that’s waiting again needs a new answer.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cualquier tarjeta que respondiste y vuelve a estar esperando necesita una respuesta nueva."}}}},
    "None of those cards is waiting for you anymore.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ninguna de esas tarjetas te sigue esperando."}}}},
    "One of those cards is waiting for you again: answer it once more.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Una de esas tarjetas vuelve a esperarte: respóndela otra vez."}}}},
    "%lld of those cards are waiting for you again: answer them once more.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld de esas tarjetas vuelven a esperarte: respóndelas otra vez."}}}},
    "Nor did it confirm what else you sent from this device just before; check it on your Mac.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tampoco confirmó lo demás que enviaste desde este dispositivo justo antes; revísalo en tu Mac."}}}},
    "Hides this notice": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Oculta este aviso"}}}},
    "Signing out didn’t finish": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo terminar de cerrar sesión"}}}},
    "Alondra couldn’t finish signing this device out. Finish signing out, then sign in again to reconnect.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no pudo terminar de cerrar la sesión de este dispositivo. Termina de cerrar sesión y vuelve a iniciarla para reconectar."}}}},
    "Finish Signing Out": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Terminar de cerrar sesión"}}}},
    "Something went wrong. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Algo ha fallado. Inténtalo de nuevo."}}}},
    "Your notification settings couldn’t be saved. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudieron guardar tus ajustes de notificaciones. Inténtalo de nuevo."}}}},
    "Alerts couldn’t be turned on. Try again in a moment.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudieron activar los avisos. Inténtalo de nuevo en un momento."}}}},
    "This iPhone couldn’t sign up for alerts. Alondra tries again when you reopen the app.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este iPhone no pudo apuntarse a los avisos. Alondra lo vuelve a intentar cuando abras la app de nuevo."}}}},
    "Alondra couldn’t reconnect to answer this alert. Open the app to reconnect.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no pudo reconectar para responder a este aviso. Abre la app para reconectar."}}}},
    "Alerts for this Mac couldn’t be set up. Alondra tries again when you reopen the app.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudieron preparar los avisos de este Mac. Alondra lo vuelve a intentar cuando abras la app de nuevo."}}}},
    "This iPhone couldn’t remove its saved alert keys. Sign out again to retry.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este iPhone no pudo borrar sus claves de avisos guardadas. Vuelve a cerrar sesión para reintentarlo."}}}},
    "Couldn’t load this card": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No se pudo cargar esta tarjeta"}}}},
    "Loading…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cargando…"}}}},
