    "Everything here is sample data. Actions stay in memory and never reach a real account. Use Reset demo to start over or Exit demo to connect your workspace.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everything here is sample data. Actions stay in memory and never reach a real account. Use Reset demo to start over or Exit demo to connect your workspace."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todo lo que ves son datos de ejemplo. Las acciones se guardan en memoria y nunca llegan a una cuenta real. Usa Reiniciar demo para empezar de nuevo o Salir de la demo para conectar tu espacio de trabajo."
