    "Direct connection": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conexión directa"}}}},
    "Devices can connect directly": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Los dispositivos pueden conectar directo"}}}},
    "Away from home, devices go through the relay": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fuera de casa, los dispositivos van por el relay"}}}},
    "Checking…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Comprobando…"}}}},
    "Can’t check right now": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ahora no se puede comprobar"}}}},
    "A device away from home already connected directly.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Un dispositivo fuera de casa ya conectó directo."}}}},
    "Even from a mobile network.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "También desde datos móviles."}}}},
    "It works, a bit slower. The steps below can make it direct.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Funciona, algo más lento. Los pasos de abajo pueden hacerlo directo."}}}},
    "Open (%@)": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Abierto (%@)"}}}},
    "Not offered by the router": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El router no lo ofrece"}}}},
    "Offered (%@), no port open": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ofrecido (%@), sin puerto abierto"}}}},
    "None": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ninguna"}}}},
    "None, public address": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ninguno, dirección pública"}}}},
    "Keeps the port": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conserva el puerto"}}}},
    "Changes the port per destination": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cambia el puerto según el destino"}}}},
    "Unknown": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Desconocido"}}}},
    "%lld direct · %lld via the relay": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld directas · %lld por el relay"}}}},
    "macOS doesn’t let Alondra use this Mac’s local network, so devices on the same Wi-Fi go through the relay.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "macOS no deja a Alondra usar la red local de este Mac, así que los dispositivos en la misma Wi-Fi van por el relay."}}}},
    "Open System Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Abre Ajustes del Sistema › Privacidad y seguridad › Red local."}}}},
    "Turn on Alondra (alondrad).": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Activa Alondra (alondrad)."}}}},
    "This section updates by itself in a few seconds.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esta sección se actualiza sola en unos segundos."}}}},
    "The relay is off, so this Mac can’t see how it looks from outside.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El relay está desactivado, así que este Mac no puede ver cómo se le ve desde fuera."}}}},
    "This Mac isn’t connected to the relay right now.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Este Mac no está conectado al relay ahora mismo."}}}},
    "This network wants a sign-in page first.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esta red pide antes una página de inicio de sesión."}}}},
    "The relay is on this same network, so this Mac can’t see its public address. Direct connections from outside work once the relay is outside your home.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El relay está en esta misma red, así que este Mac no ve su dirección pública. La conexión directa desde fuera funcionará cuando el relay esté fuera de casa."}}}},
    "This network doesn’t let UDP out, and direct connections need it.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esta red no deja salir UDP, y la conexión directa lo necesita."}}}},
    "The router changes the port for every destination, so devices can’t find a way in.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El router cambia el puerto para cada destino, así que los dispositivos no encuentran por dónde entrar."}}}},
    "The router doesn’t open ports by itself (UPnP, NAT-PMP or PCP).": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El router no abre puertos por sí solo (UPnP, NAT-PMP o PCP)."}}}},
    "The router can open ports by itself but didn’t open one for this Mac.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El router puede abrir puertos por sí solo, pero no ha abierto uno para este Mac."}}}},
    "This network has no IPv6.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esta red no tiene IPv6."}}}},
    "Another app uses the usual port, so this one changes when Alondra restarts and forwarding it won’t last.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Otra app usa el puerto habitual, así que este cambia al reiniciar Alondra y reenviarlo no duraría."}}}},
    "Open your router’s settings: its app, or its address in a browser.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Abre los ajustes del router: su app, o su dirección en un navegador."}}}},
    "Turn on UPnP or NAT-PMP. Some routers call it PCP or automatic port forwarding.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Activa UPnP o NAT-PMP. Algunos routers lo llaman PCP o reenvío automático de puertos."}}}},
    "Or forward UDP port %@ to %@, this Mac.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "O reenvía el puerto UDP %@ a %@, este Mac."}}}},
    "With IPv6, allow incoming UDP to this Mac on port %@ in the router’s firewall.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Con IPv6, permite en el cortafuegos del router UDP entrante a este Mac en el puerto %@."}}}},
    "This section updates by itself in a few minutes.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esta sección se actualiza sola en unos minutos."}}}},
    "The router answers UPnP or NAT-PMP but refused this Mac: check they are fully on and not limited to some devices.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El router responde a UPnP o NAT-PMP pero ha rechazado a este Mac: comprueba que están activados del todo y no limitados a algunos dispositivos."}}}},
    "Port mapping": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mapeo de puertos"}}}},
    "IPv6": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "IPv6"}}}},
    "NAT": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "NAT"}}}},
    "UDP port": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Puerto UDP"}}}},
    "Recent connections": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Conexiones recientes"}}}},
    "How to make it direct": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cómo hacerlo directo"}}}},
    "Sign in to %@": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inicia sesión en %@"}}}},
    "Opening the sign-in…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Abriendo el inicio de sesión…"}}}},
    "Sign in to %@ in the page that opened. Alondra brings the sign-in back to your Mac by itself, and the waiting tasks go on.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inicia sesión en %@ en la página que se ha abierto. Alondra lleva la sesión a tu Mac por sí sola, y las tareas que esperan siguen."}}}},
    "Sign in to %@ in the browser. Claude on this Mac gets the sign-in by itself, and the waiting tasks go on.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inicia sesión en %@ en el navegador. Claude recoge la sesión en este Mac por sí solo, y las tareas que esperan siguen."}}}},
    "Sign in to %@ in the browser. Afterwards the browser shows a page that does not load: copy its address and paste it here.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Inicia sesión en %@ en el navegador. Después el navegador muestra una página que no carga: copia su dirección y pégala aquí."}}}},
    "%@ is a claude.ai connector. Connect it on claude.ai in the page that opened, then press Reconnect.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%@ es un conector de claude.ai. Conéctalo en claude.ai en la página que se ha abierto y luego pulsa Reconectar."}}}},
    "Signing in to %@…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Iniciando sesión en %@…"}}}},
    "The waiting tasks read their sign-in to %@ again, and go on once it is connected.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Las tareas que esperan vuelven a leer su sesión en %@ y siguen en cuanto esté conectado."}}}},
    "Signed in to %@: the waiting tasks go on.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sesión iniciada en %@: las tareas que esperan siguen."}}}},
    "That is not the address the browser came back to. Copy the whole address of the page that did not load: it starts with http://localhost: and has /callback.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esa no es la dirección a la que volvió el navegador. Copia la dirección completa de la página que no cargó: empieza por http://localhost: y tiene /callback."}}}},
    "The sign-in to %@ was cut. Press Connect again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "El inicio de sesión en %@ se cortó. Pulsa Conectar otra vez."}}}},
    "No task that waits for %@ can open its sign-in now. Try again in a moment, or go on without it from the card.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ninguna tarea que espera a %@ puede abrir su inicio de sesión ahora. Vuelve a intentarlo en un momento o sigue sin él desde la tarjeta."}}}},
    "Alondra could not reach your Mac. Try again.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Alondra no pudo conectar con tu Mac. Vuelve a intentarlo."}}}},
    "Did the page after signing in not load? Paste its address here.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "¿No cargó la página después de iniciar sesión? Pega aquí su dirección."}}}},
    "http://localhost:…/callback?…": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "http://localhost:…/callback?…"}}}},
    "That is not the address the browser came back to: it starts with http://localhost: and has /callback.": {"localizations": {"es": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Esa no es la dirección a la que volvió el navegador: empieza por http://localhost: y tiene /callback."}}}},
